---
const badges = [
  {
    title: 'Handshake Integrity',
    description: "A deal sealed with a handshake is a deal kept. He'll give you the shirt off his back before he lets you down.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Overbuilt by Principle',
    description: "If it's worth building, it's worth overbuilding. Every weld, mount, and bracket goes in stronger than it needs to be.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Authentic Craftsmanship',
    description: "No shortcuts, no filler. Every build is filmed, documented, and finished the same way it started &mdash; honest.",
  },
];
---

<section id="about-builder" class="border-y border-rig-700 bg-rig-900 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:px-8">
    <div class="order-2 flex justify-center lg:order-1">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-2xl bg-ember-600/10 blur-2xl"></div>
        <img
          src="/images/builder-bronze.jpg"
          alt="Bronze relief plaque of Oley Larsen, FrankinFord's builder, in a cowboy hat holding the shop's hand-fabricated piston emblem"
          class="relative w-full max-w-sm rounded-2xl border border-rig-600 object-cover shadow-2xl shadow-black/50"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-ember-500">Meet the Builder</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-50 sm:text-4xl">
        Oley Larsen &mdash; Our Own Dr. Frankenstein
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-zinc-400">
        <p>
          Every shop needs a mad scientist, and Oley has spent a lifetime under Ford iron to earn the
          title. He's cut, welded, and fixed more steel than most men touch in a lifetime &mdash; and
          he's still the first one in the shop and the last one to leave.
        </p>
        <p>
          A devoted family man and a man of faith first, he runs the shop the same way he runs his
          life: hard work, honest prayer, and a little grease under the fingernails on Sunday morning.
          His wife will tell you there are a few more empty whiskey bottles tucked around the property
          than she'd like to admit &mdash; call it fuel for the late nights spent making sure your build
          is done right.
        </p>
        <p>
          His word is his bond. He'll give you the shirt off his back, overbuild every inch of your
          rig so it can't be broken, and send you out the door with more truck than you asked for.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {badges.map((badge) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-rig-700 bg-rig-950 p-5">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-ember-500">{badge.title}</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">{badge.description}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10">
        <a
          href="#quote"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-ember-600 px-8 py-4 font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-rig-950 transition hover:bg-ember-500"
        >
          Request a Build Consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
